ity) + (Privileges Required * User Interaction) + Scope\n\n= (A * L) + (L * N) + U\n= 2.9 + 0.6 + 0.0\n= 3.5\n\n**Vector String**: The vector string will be in the format \"CVSS:3.1/AV:_/AC:_/PR:_/UI:_/S:_/C:_/I:_/A:_\". Based on our calculations, this would be:\n\n\"CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\"\n\n**Base Score**: The base score is 3.5.\n\nHere's the output in JSON format:\n\n```\n{\n  \"attack_vector\": \"A\",\n  \"attack_complexity\": \"L\",\n  \"privileges_required\": \"L\",\n  \"user_interaction\": \"N\",\n  \"scope\": \"U\",\n  \"confidentiality_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"integrity_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"availability_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\",\n  \"base_score\": 3.5\n}\n```\n\nPlease note that this assessment is based solely on the provided vulnerability description and does not take into account any external knowledge or assumptions.",
